  "replies": {
    "imminent_risk": [
      {
        "id": "im-1",
        "text": "I'm here. Thank you for telling me instead of holding it alone."
      },
      {
        "id": "im-2",
        "text": "I've read what you wrote, all of it. I'm not going anywhere."
      },
      {
        "id": "im-3",
        "text": "That sounds like it has been building for a long time. I'm still here with you."
      }
    ],
    "imminent_risk_follow": [
      {
        "id": "imf-1",
        "text": "You don't have to solve anything in this conversation. I'd just like to keep you company right now."
      },
      {
        "id": "imf-2",
        "text": "Nothing you say here will be judged. Take your time with me."
      }
    ],
    "self_harm_urge": [
      {
        "id": "sh-1",
        "text": "That urge sounds exhausting to hold, and I'm glad you told me instead of carrying it quietly."
      },
      {
        "id": "sh-2",
        "text": "It makes sense that your body is looking for a way to make the pain stop. I'm here with you."
      }
    ],
    "abuse_safety": [
      {
        "id": "ab-1",
        "text": "I believe you. What you described is not something you caused, and it is not something you have to work out alone."
      },
      {
        "id": "ab-2",
        "text": "Thank you for trusting me with that. I'm taking it seriously. What happened is not your fault."
      }
    ],
    "hopelessness": [
      {
        "id": "hp-1",
        "text": "When nothing looks like it will change, even getting through today takes effort. I see that."
      },
      {
        "id": "hp-2",
        "text": "That kind of tiredness is real. It isn't laziness, and it isn't weakness."
      },
      {
        "id": "hp-3",
        "text": "Hopelessness lies to people. It tells them they are a burden and that it will never lift. I don't think it's telling you the truth."
      }
    ],
    "panic": [
      {
        "id": "pn-1",
        "text": "That sounds frightening. Your body is reacting to danger it thinks is here right now, and it is very hard to think through that."
      },
      {
        "id": "pn-2",
        "text": "Panic feels like dying while being completely safe. It is terrible, and it does pass."
      }
    ],
    "grief_loss": [
      {
        "id": "gr-1",
        "text": "I'm sorry. There is nothing that makes that lighter, and you don't have to be fine about it here."
      },
      {
        "id": "gr-2",
        "text": "Grief doesn't keep to a schedule. Whatever you're feeling right now is an honest reaction, not a wrong one."
      }
    ],
    "self_blame": [
      {
        "id": "sb-1",
        "text": "You are allowed to have made mistakes and still be worth something. Both are true at once."
      },
      {
        "id": "sb-2",
        "text": "That voice that says you deserve this is not a fair judge. It's just loud."
      }
    ],
    "isolation": [
      {
        "id": "is-1",
        "text": "Being alone with this makes everything heavier. For the next few minutes you are not alone in it."
      },
      {
        "id": "is-2",
        "text": "It's strange how a room full of people can feel emptier than a message from one stranger. I'm glad you wrote."
      }
    ],
    "anger": [
      {
        "id": "an-1",
        "text": "Anger usually shows up when something important to you has been treated badly. It's information, not a flaw."
      },
      {
        "id": "an-2",
        "text": "That sounds like a lot of pressure that has been building for a while."
      }
    ],
    "relationship": [
      {
        "id": "rl-1",
        "text": "Being left or let go of leaves a very specific kind of tiredness behind. I'm sorry."
      },
      {
        "id": "rl-2",
        "text": "That hurt is real, and it doesn't need to be reasonable to be real."
      }
    ],
    "academic_pressure": [
      {
        "id": "ac-1",
        "text": "Marks and deadlines can start to feel like they are measuring your whole worth. They are not."
      },
      {
        "id": "ac-2",
        "text": "That pressure must be very loud at home and inside your head at the same time."
      }
    ],
    "physical_health": [
      {
        "id": "ph-1",
        "text": "Worry that lives in your body is hard to argue with. I'm sorry you're carrying it."
      },
      {
        "id": "ph-2",
        "text": "Not sleeping makes everything else harder. That's not you failing at anything."
      }
    ],
    "help_seeking": [
      {
        "id": "hs-1",
        "text": "I can show you people who do this well, any time of day. I'll only bring them up if you want me to."
      },
      {
        "id": "hs-2",
        "text": "There are people trained for exactly this, and reaching them costs nothing. Want me to put their details on the screen?"
      }
    ],
    "meta": [
      {
        "id": "mt-1",
        "text": "I'm a simple text-based guide, not a person and not a therapist. I won't ask you to explain yourself, and I won't judge you."
      },
      {
        "id": "mt-2",
        "text": "This is a quiet place to put things down. Nothing here asks for your name, and nothing is kept unless you ask me to keep it."
      }
    ],
    "stuck": [
      {
        "id": "st-1",
        "text": "That's alright. We can just sit here. Nothing is expected of you in this conversation."
      },
      {
        "id": "st-2",
        "text": "You don't have to find the right words. Whatever comes out is enough."
      }
    ],
    "tired": [
      {
        "id": "tr-1",
        "text": "Being that tired is a full body thing. It isn't something to push through or fix in one conversation."
      },
      {
        "id": "tr-2",
        "text": "Rest is not something you have to earn. You're allowed to stop for a while."
      }
    ],
    "thanks": [
      {
        "id": "tk-1",
        "text": "You don't have to thank me. I'm glad you're here."
      },
      {
        "id": "tk-2",
        "text": "I'm glad you wrote. That's all."
      }
    ],
    "feeling_better": [
      {
        "id": "fb-1",
        "text": "I'm glad it's a little lighter. We can go slowly from here."
      },
      {
        "id": "fb-2",
        "text": "That's good to hear. Nothing has to be decided today."
      }
    ],
    "goodbye": [
      {
        "id": "gb-1",
        "text": "Take care of yourself. This door stays open, no name needed."
      },
      {
        "id": "gb-2",
        "text": "Thank you for being here with me. Go gently."
      }
    ],
    "reflective": [
      {
